The Shield already correctly shares waveOffset() with the Void and receives Arena.fxTime, so keep that architecture.

Current Shield behavior:

* SHIELD_SHAPE.amp is only 0.045, which makes the movement very subtle.
* shieldOutline() correctly produces a time-driven wavy circle.
* Reduced-motion correctly freezes the animation at time = 0.
* The black Shield rim is drawn on the primary outline.
